{title: Jesus Loves Me}
{artist: Anna B. Warner / William B. Bradbury}
{genre: Hymn, Children}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Traditional}
{key: C}
{tempo: 88}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 563장}
{title_ko: 예수 사랑하심을}
{score: jesus-loves-me.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Jesus loves me! This I [F]know
For the [C]Bible tells me [G]so
Little [C]ones to Him be[F]long
They are [C]weak but He is [G]strong[C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Yes, Jesus [F]loves me
[C]Yes, Jesus [G]loves me
[C]Yes, Jesus [F]loves me
The [C]Bible [G]tells me [C]so
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Jesus loves me! He who [F]died
[C]Heaven's gate to open [G]wide
He will [C]wash away my [F]sin
Let His [C]little child come [G]in[C]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Jesus take this heart of [F]mine
[C]Make it pure and wholly [G]Thine
Thou hast [C]bled and died for [F]me
I will [C]henceforth live for [G]Thee[C]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
